  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "土壤動力學",
    "sub_ename": "SOIL DYNAMICS",
    "describe_ch": "土壤動力學將研習以下的主題：(1)振動原理及機械基礎的設計考量因素；(2)彈性介質中傳播的波之種類及其特性；(3)土壤液化分析；(4)振動對土壤的承載力、沉陷量、及側向土壓力等之影響；(5)建築物耐震設計規範相關內容。",
    "describe_eh": "Soil dynamics includes the following topics: (1) Vibration principles and design considerations for mechanical foundations; (2) Types and characteristics of waves propagating in elastic media; (3) Liquefaction analysis of soil; (4) Effects of vibration on soil bearing capacity, settlement, and lateral soil pressure; and (5) Relevant content of building seismic design specifications.",
